OL,3,AEdinburgh launches new media event
OL,4,Aafter final TV Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new Scottish event to
OL,7,Freplace the Edinburgh TV Festival have
OL,8,Fbeen launched.
OL,10,FThe industry festival ` which ends on
OL,11,FFriday ` will move to Manchester next
OL,12,Fyear after 50 years in the capital.
OL,14,FBut Screen Scotland, the Scottish
OL,15,Fgovernment and the other Edinburgh
OL,16,FFestivals say it is too important to
OL,17,Flose.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
