OL,3,AEdinburgh launches new media event
OL,4,Aafter final TV Festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking at a launch event in
OL,7,FEdinburgh, Culture Secretary MC iri
OL,8,FMcAllan, revealed details of a new
OL,9,Finitiative which would build on the
OL,10,Fcity's unique position as a global shop
OL,11,Fwindow for talent, content and creative
OL,12,Fideas.
